{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15枚目シングル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだどんな曲かわからないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても楽しみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近自分でも自分のことがよくわからないのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私を好きって言ってくれるみなさんがいるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変わらずやってみます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏たくさん笑顔共有したいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から3日間はてんこ盛りの日々だぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず今夜20時～はMステ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバムのリード曲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「きっかけ」初披露するよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演出にもドキドキなのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてねみてね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてその後はいよいよ46時間TVー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オープニングは見逃しちゃだめだよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん何かあるからっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深夜は人狼ゲーム。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回役立たずだったので、リベンジや！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になる乃木坂電子台"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は一人〇〇！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに楽しんでもらいたくて試行錯誤してみたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったらみてねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間は11日の夕方早め頃かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回番組MCを